@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@token = 请替换为登录响应中的token

### 健康检查
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### 微信登录，code 来自 uni.login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "微信登录code"
}

### 手机号快速验证：两个 code 的用途不同
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/wechat-phone
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loginCode": "uni.login返回的code",
  "phoneCode": "getPhoneNumber事件返回的code"
}

### 课程列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 动作列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/exercises?bodyPart=胸部
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 当前计划
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/plans/current
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 新增训练记录
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/workout-records
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courseId": 1,
  "durationMinutes": 25,
  "completionPercent": 100,
  "startedAt": "2026-08-20T10:00:00Z"
}

### 训练统计
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/workout-records/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 个人资料
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 注销
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

